  _senarioDescription: 'You look around for anything that you could possibly use
    to block the door with. First thing you see is an old locker that looks like
    the perfect fit for the job. You go to pick up the locker and successfully and
    proceed to barricade the door to the basement. Just as you finished setting it
    up. Bang! Bang! Bang! That thing is trying to get in but your barricade holds
    strong. After a few minutes you hear it walk away, leaving you uneasy and suspicious.
    You decided it would be best to camp down here for the night. In the morning
    you listen for anything weird upstairs, after a while of nothing you decide to
    remove your barricade and take a look around. Peaking out into the living room
    you don''t see anyone, but you do notice the front door wide open. Upon getting
    closer you notice some  prints leading to woods. Leaving you an uneasy feeling
    about its potential return. \nI''ll get the smores - Ending '
